From 88c1c2469334b515e1423c200b843ca8e70589be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 19:08:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 250/638] gpu: retain validating decoder fallback on AROS
 [chromium] [aros]

AI_PHASE: chromium-phase-5-gpu-fallback
AI_STATUS: implemented
ROOT_CAUSE: AROS could enter a non-passthrough GLES2 command-buffer path while the validating decoder factory was compiled out, causing LOG(FATAL).
FIX_REASON: Keep Chromium's validating decoder compiled so unavailable passthrough degrades to the supported command path instead of aborting before AROS selects a Gallium renderer.
SCOPE: Build-time AROS decoder availability only; renderer selection and Ozone EGL/Gallium exposure remain separate.
VALIDATION: generated ENABLE_VALIDATING_COMMAND_DECODER=1; rebuilt gles2 decoder object excludes the unsupported fatal; 273-step incremental full chrome link; ninja no-work verification.
RISK: Low; this retains Chromium's existing decoder implementation and preserves runtime passthrough selection.
AI_DECISION_CHAIN: ACD-chromium-native-port-roadmap;;
---
 ui/gl/features.gni | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ui/gl/features.gni b/ui/gl/features.gni
index 06806b8ceb..00ede2313d 100644
--- a/ui/gl/features.gni
+++ b/ui/gl/features.gni
@@ -27,7 +27,7 @@ declare_args() {
   # Independent of use_dawn, which controls whether Dawn is used in Chromium.
   build_dawn_tests = is_mac || is_win || is_linux || is_chromeos || is_android
 
-  enable_validating_command_decoder = is_android
+  enable_validating_command_decoder = is_android || is_aros
 }
 
 declare_args() {
